# idbrandingandadvertising.com: project rules

Site rule for `websites/idbrandingandadvertising.com/`. It applies in addition to the global rules in `.cursor/rules/`; where they conflict, the global rules win. Paths are relative to the site folder.

## Site shape
- Multi-page studio brochure: Home, About, Work (section with six gallery children), Clients, Contact.
- Content comes from the live Adobe Edge site via `npm run import:id`. Do not invent founder names, founding years, or services beyond the about page competencies.
- One office: Zalka, Cite Moussa, block C, 6th floor. Phones `+961 1 902 842`, `+961 3 455 102`. Email `info@idbrandingandadvertising.com`.
- Social: Facebook, X (twitter field), LinkedIn from the legacy contact page. No shop / brochureUrl button.
- Captcha scopes: `admin-login`, `contact`.
- Legacy HTML paths redirect through `data/redirects.json`.

## Design
- Studio redesign (not the Edge splash). Colours from `assets/id.png`: charcoal I.D mark `#231f20`, magenta ampersand sample `#a8178c` (deepened to `#7d1169` for AA text/buttons), yellow period `#f5c518`.
- Tokens in `public/scss/_tokens.scss`. Fonts: Syne (headings), Manrope (body).
- Home: type hero, numbered services, work mosaic, client marquee, contact block. Work index uses the mosaic; category pages use the masonry gallery + lightbox.
